flowchart LR
    Web[SPA web] -->|HTTPS + OIDC token| Gateway[API Gateway]
    Mobile[App móvil] -->|HTTPS + OIDC token| Gateway
    POS[POS / canal digital] -->|Compra + idempotency key| Gateway
    Identity[Proveedor OIDC<br/>Cognito / Entra / Google] -.->|emite JWT| Web
    Identity -.->|emite JWT| Mobile
    Gateway --> Customer[Customer Service]
    Gateway --> Rules[Rules Service]
    Gateway --> Accrual[Purchase & Accrual Service]
    Gateway --> Ledger[Loyalty Ledger Service]
    Gateway --> Redemption[Redemption Service]
    Gateway --> Reporting[Reporting Service]

    Customer --> CustomerDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Customer DB)]
    Rules --> RulesDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Rules DB)]
    Accrual --> AccrualDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Accrual DB)]
    Ledger --> LedgerDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Ledger DB<br/>saldo autoritativo)]
    Redemption --> RedemptionDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Redemption DB)]
    Reporting --> ReportingDB[(PostgreSQL<br/>Reporting read model)]

    Accrual -->|consulta reglas| Rules
    Accrual -->|registra puntos idempotentes| Ledger
    Redemption -->|reserva / confirma puntos| Ledger
    Accrual -.->|outbox| Bus{{Event bus}}
    Ledger -.->|outbox| Bus
    Redemption -.->|outbox| Bus
    Bus --> Queue[Cola por consumidor + DLQ]
    Queue -->|consumo al menos una vez| Reporting
    Accrual -.-> Cache[(Redis opcional<br/>aislado por servicio)]
    Rules -.-> Cache

    classDef proposed stroke-dasharray: 5 5;
    class Gateway,Customer,Rules,Accrual,Ledger,Redemption,Reporting,Bus,Queue proposed;
